The code uses Boost library for MD5 hashing, stream manipulation for file I/O, and OpenSSL for MD5 calculations. The program is designed to handle large files efficiently by limiting memory usage to 25% of available system RAM at any point during execution. It also includes a robust error-handling mechanism that manages potential exceptions from third-party libraries used for hashing.

