The function handles memory allocation and deallocation by using standard containers that manage their own memory. It also sorts the sessions by SessionID for efficient retrieval and processing. However, it doesn't include error handling or fallback mechanisms for data corruption or network interruptions as you requested. You can extend this code to meet those requirements based on your specific use case."]

